# UI and pages

`"use client"` only when the file needs state, events, or context. Pages stay server components and pass fetched data into client children.

`Container` is `max-w-modimal` (`--container-modimal: 1240px`). Tokens in `src/app/globals.css`: paper `#FDFBF7`, sable ink `#1C1A17` (`--ink`, `--brand-navy`), muted ink `#6B635B` (`--ink-muted`, `--muted-foreground`, `--brand-slate`), rosewood CTA `#8F6565` (`--brand`, `--primary`; hover `#7A5454`), focus ring `#A87C7C`, taupe border `#E1DCD6`, olive `#5F6E50` (sustainability chips only). Fonts: Source Sans 3 (`--font-sans-var`) for UI; Cormorant Garamond (`--font-serif-var`) for wordmark (`tracking-wordmark`) and `.heading-page` / `.heading-section`. Body copy leading is `leading-copy`. Eyebrow tracking is `tracking-eyebrow`. Radius is 0, except color swatches and carousel dots, which stay circles. Focus rings are `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring`. Rosewood is fills only — links stay sable (`hover:text-brand-navy`). Button variants come from `src/components/ui/button.tsx` (`default`, `outline`, `secondary`, `ghost`, `destructive`, `link`), with `size="xl"` (`h-12`) for storefront CTAs. `cn` is the `cn` package, re-exported by `src/lib/utils.ts`.

ProductCard links to `/product/${product.id}`. The heart on the card is decorative. Wishlist toggles live on the purchase panel. Product rails use `ProductCardRail`. PDPs use `ProductExperience`. PLPs use `CatalogBrowser` / `CatalogFilters`. Policy routes use `PolicyPage`.

Header and mobile nav read flat `NAV_ITEMS` from `src/data/navigation.ts` (New Arrivals, Dresses, Tops, Jeans, Matching Sets). There is no header mega menu. `COLLECTION_MEGA_MENU` feeds `/collection` only; `SUSTAINABILITY_MEGA_MENU` feeds the story page. `fetchShopifyNavItems` is not wired up. Announcement bar: “Free Shipping On Orders Within The United States”.

Static and still the source of truth for chrome/content: `navigation.ts`, `faq.ts`, `sustainability.ts`, `shipping-policy.ts`, and shop-all hero slides. `home.ts` / `modiweek.ts` / `plus-size.ts` / search filter objects remain as legacy data; live home does not import `home.ts`, and PLP filters come from Shopify. Contact, newsletter, and “Start Chat” use mailto or local UI only. `/modiweek` and `/plus-size` redirect to `/collection/new-arrivals`. `/sustainability/mission` CTAs to `/contact-us` (no `/sustainability/suppliers` page).

Do not add `data-testid` unless a test needs it. E2E uses roles and accessible names from `e2e/helpers/fixtures.ts`, not `@playwright/test` directly. Prefer the components the page already imports.
